" extensions · 1 · tools 1+0/<max>
 extensions  tools  usage

 ▾ ● lint    0/1 tools  active    lint · script · active · tools 0/1 pinned · current v-<hash>
                                  root .nulya/extensions
                                  tools lint · skills — · prompts —

                                  versions · 1
                                    v-<hash>  <built>  ⚡ current  ▎ this session

                                  usage
                                    lint · 0 uses · —







 Enter on/off · j/k move · h/l pane · Esc close · ? keys
"
`;
